      <activity id="bda7f5d7-c0b9-5fd7-8dfb-721457cfee69" activityNameId="a85da0b7-942d-58a6-ae46-33d098554c00" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mastic asphalt (MA), 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mastic asphalt (MA), 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: bb409954-e8cc-44b6-abca-dcae40903a18
This dataset covers the production of average mastic asphalt in Switzerland, with 0% reclaimed asphalt. The process represents an average MA, derived from the mean material composition of MA 4, MA 8, MA 11 and MA 16 layers. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix mastic asphalt, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bb409954-e8cc-44b6-abca-dcae40903a18.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
